      "badge": '10" Active Studio Subwoofer',
      "sku": "ADAM-T10S-SGL",
      "description": "\n      <p>The <strong>ADAM Audio T10S</strong> is a powerful yet compact active subwoofer, with a particularly attractive price/performance ratio, designed for extending the bass range of smaller and medium nearfield monitors. Its dimensions make the T10S especially useful for home studio and semi-professional use. The subwoofer\u2019s performance, features, and connectivity are engineered specifically to complement ADAM Audio\u2019s T5V and T7V speakers.</p>\n\n      <p>Equipped with a downward-firing 10\u02DD woofer, ample-sized bass reflex port, and commanding 130-watt Class-D amplifier, the T10S\u2019 frequency response ranges from 28 Hz to 120 Hz and offers an impressive maximum sound pressure level of 104 dB.</p>\n\n      <p>An adjustable low-pass filter for matching to satellites, automatic or manual on/off, and four acoustically decoupling rubber feet complete the T10S's features. The qualities of the T10S subwoofer have found favor in numerous tests by the international trade press.</p>\n\n      <h3>Key Technical Specifications:</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Frequency Response:</strong> 28 Hz \u2013 120 Hz (-6 dB)</li>\n        <li><strong>Amplifier Type & Power:</strong> PWM (Class-D), 130 W RMS</li>\n        <li><strong>THD > 60 Hz:</strong> 0.6%</li>\n        <li><strong>Max. SPL at 1 m (hemisphere):</strong> \u2265104 dB</li>\n        <li><strong>Max. Power Consumption:</strong> 190 W</li>\n        <li><strong>Input Sensitivity:</strong> +4 dBu / -10 dBV switchable</li>\n        <li><strong>Bypass:</strong> Yes, via footswitch (not included)</li>\n        <li><strong>Standby:</strong> Yes, activates automatically after 15 minutes of inactivity</li>\n        <li><strong>Weight:</strong> 27 lb (12.2 kg)</li>\n        <li><strong>Dimensions (H x W x D):</strong> 15.4\u2033 x 12.5\u2033 x 16.25\u2033 (390 mm x 318 mm x 413 mm)</li>\n        <li><strong>Warranty:</strong> 5 years (2 years warranty plus 3 years optional with product registration)</li>\n      </ul>\n    ",
