      "description": 'Audiophile 3.5mm Stereo TRS to Dual RCA (Male to Male) Interconnect Cable \u2013 1.2m\nBridge high-fidelity audio equipment with no loss in detail. The Arowana Audioglyph 3.5mm to dual RCA cable combines dense shielding, solid metal housings, and 24k gold-plated termination to deliver pure, transparent stereo sound between your source devices and home or studio amplification gear.\n\nDetailed Description:\n\nStandard auxiliary cables often suffer from thin shielding, weak grounds, and cheap plastic shells that introduce noise and degrade frequency response. The Arowana Audioglyph 3.5mm to 2RCA cable is built specifically for audiophiles, sound designers, and recording enthusiasts who demand broadcast-grade fidelity.\n\nConstructed with high-purity conductors and an internal shield layer, this cable ensures complete isolation against EMI and RFI noise. The exterior features a braided, textured protective sleeve designed to lay flat on equipment racks while resisting abrasion and bending stress. Both RCA connectors and the 3.5mm stereo plug are finished with gold plating and rigid metal barrels, providing low contact resistance and a tight, reliable fit.\n\nTechnical Specifications\nSpecification Detail Connector A 3.5mm (1/8") TRS Male (Stereo)\n\nConnector B2x RCA Male (Left: White / Right: Red)\n\nConnector Plating Gold-Plated Contacts\n\nShell Material Precision Machined Metal Alloy\n\nShielding Full High-Density Audio Shielding (EMI/RFI protection)\n\nOuter Jacket Premium Braided Pattern Sleeve\n\nLength1.5 Meters (~5 Feet)ApplicationStudio Monitors, Amplifiers, AV Receivers, DACs, DJ Mixers, DAP/PC Output',
