      "description": "Clean Power. Pristine Audio. Space-Saving Design.\nThe foundation of great sound starts at the wall. Generic power cables can restrict current delivery and introduce unwanted noise into your signal chain. Engineered specifically for demanding audio and audiophile applications, the Arowana Audioglyph C13 Power Cable (1.5 Meter) delivers stable, unrestricted AC power to your critical gear.\nBuilt with thick, high-grade copper conductors and a space-saving right-angle C13 connector, this 10-amp cable ensures your studio monitors, amplifiers, and outboard racks perform at their absolute peak.Key Features & BenefitsAudiophile-Grade Copper Conductors:\nMaximizes current transfer and minimizes resistance, ensuring your high-draw amplifiers and studio monitors receive instantaneous, clean power without voltage sags.\nSpace-Saving Right-Angle C13: The low-profile right-angle IEC connector allows you to push your heavy studio racks, guitar amps, and studio desks flush against the wall without severely bending or damaging the cable.\nHeavy-Duty Indian Plug: Features a robust, custom-molded Indian standard 3-pin plug with heavy-duty strain relief to prevent wire fraying at the most common point of failure.10-Amp Power Capacity:\nSafely handles the continuous power draw of professional audio equipment, providing peace of mind during long recording sessions or live performances.\nRugged Outer Jacket: Wrapped in a thick, flexible PVC jacket that protects the internal wiring from physical wear and tear while remaining easy to route through complex studio setups.\nTechnical Specifications Parameter Specification\nBrand Arowana Audioglyph Cable\nType AC Mains Power CableConductor\nMaterial High-Grade Copper Connector\nStandard Indian 3-Pin PlugConnector to Right-Angle IEC C13\nPower Rating10 Amps\nApplication Studio Monitors, Amplifiers, Rack Gear, Audiophile Systems\n\nWhy Power Matters for AudioIn high-fidelity setups, starved power supplies lead to compromised transient response and a muddy low-end. By upgrading to a high-grade copper power cable, you ensure your equipment's power supply capacitors charge instantly, translating to tighter bass, wider dynamic range, and a remarkably lower noise floor\nThe Shielded Advantage In environments packed with massive transformers, wireless signals, and overlapping cable runs, the power cable often acts as an antenna for noise. The active shielding in this 10A cable traps and grounds that interference before it can enter your power supply, resulting in a noticeably blacker background and improved audio clarity",
