      "description": "Ultra-Portable Design\nPocket-sized and lightweight, perfect for travel, home practice, or quick jam sessions.\n\nRechargeable Battery\nUSB-C rechargeable with hours of playtime \u2014 no need for extra adapters or power supplies.\n\n80 Presets & 20 IRs\nShape your sound with 80 editable presets and 20 cabinet simulations (with 3rd party IR support).\n\nBest Value in India\nAffordable, feature-packed, and ideal for beginners, students, and gigging musicians on the go.\nDescription\nDonner Pocket-X Multi Effects Guitar Pedal \u2013 Guitar/Bass AMP Modeler & Processor\nThe Donner Pocket-X is a compact, portable, and rechargeable multi-effects guitar pedal designed for guitarists and bassists who want powerful tones on the go. With 6 effects modules, 80 built-in presets, and 20 IR cabinet simulations, it offers everything from classic amp modeling to modern effects in one pocket-sized unit.\n\n 6 Effects Modules\nIncludes drive, modulation, delay, reverb, amp models, and cab IRs to shape your tone fully.\n\n 80 Presets\nComes with 40 factory presets and 40 user slots to save your custom sounds.\n\n 20 IR Cabinet Sims\nRealistic impulse responses for amp & cabinet tones. Supports third-party IR loading.\n\n Portable & Rechargeable\nBuilt-in rechargeable battery gives hours of playtime \u2013 perfect for gigs, practice, or travel.\n\nProduct Details\nCompact multi-effects pedal for electric guitar & bass\n6 effect modules: Drive, Modulation, Delay, Reverb, Amp, Cab\n80 Presets: 40 factory + 40 user editable\n20 IR Cabinet simulations (supports 3rd-party IRs)\nRechargeable lithium battery \u2013 long-lasting portable use\nUSB-C port for fast charging & firmware updates\nLightweight pocket design for gig bags and travel",
