      "sku": "AK-DSM-HUMBOLDT-SIMPLIFIER-BASS-MASTER-PREAMP-MUG2WVS8",
      "description": "DSM & Humboldt Simplifier Bass Master\n\nFrom DSM & Humboldt, the creators of the legendary Bass Station comes the long-awaited revision: the Bass Master. Like the original, the Bass Master is a portable and versatile bass preamp and DI with built-in cabinet simulator. Unlike the original, the Bass Master now features a separate drive mode, giving you the choice between three different preamp styles including clean, comp and hot. Also in tow is a 4-band eq, a tweeter mix knob, and a porting knob, giving you access to the sound of an open or sealed cab and everything in between.\n\n\n\nThe Bass Master retains all the player-friendly features of the original, including three switchable cab sizes and two separate FX loops, one that goes through the preamp and another parallel loop that gets the clean signal with a switchable low-pass filter. The EQ has also been revised, adding an additional band for control over a broader range of the frequency spectrum. Regardless of your genre or playing-style, the Bass Master from DSM & Humboldt is an essential choice for any bassist looking for the texture and depth of a bass amp, all in a portable form factor.\n\n\n\nSimplifier Bass Master Features\n\nAll analog bass preamp, DI, and cabinet simulator\n3 preamp modes: Clean, Comp, and Hot\n4-Band equalizer\n3 cab sizes: 4x10, 8x10, and 1x15\nTweeter mix control\nAuxilliary input\nHeadphone output\nDual FX Loop\n2 TS outputs with parallel/through",
