      "description": 'SIMPLIFIER DLX ZERO WATT DUAL CHANNEL & REVERB STEREO AMPLIFIER\n\nTHE ULTIMATE SIMPLIFIER EXPERIENCE\n\nPLUG. SET. PLAY.\n\n"Unlike many modelers with deep menus, our REAL knobs make REAL changes"\n\nULTRA CONECTIVITY PLATFORM\n\nUse it as a stereo 2-channel amplifier, or 2-parallel amplifiers for full stereo signal chain, or with 2 guitars at the same time, each with its own amp and fx loop\n\nTWO FULLY INDEPENDENT PREAMPS\n\n2 studio grade preamps capable of modeling iconic amplifiers tones. \u2028Each channel boasts: 3 preamp types (MS Brit, American, AC Brit) 3 Gain modes (Clean, Crunch and Lead)\n\nMULTI-STAGE STEREO REVERB\n\n\u2028Including a full stereo reverb, with mix control for each channel independently. \u2028 3 reverb modes Short: ROOM STYLE Mid: PLATE STYLE Long: ETHER STYLE\n\nOTHER FEATURES\n\nLeft and Right POWER AMP SIM (Post-Preamp) and two independent CABSIMSwith selectable COMBO(1X12), STACK (2X12) and TWIN (2X12) cabinets.\u2028\n\nHigh grade HEADPHONE AMP with AUX INPUT for silent practice.\n\nHEAVY DUTY self designed anodized aluminium case\n\nLOW POWER CONSUMPTION:\u2028\n\n200mA / 9V center negative\u2028\n\nCOMPACT SIZE:\u2028\n\n10x10x6.5 cms -- 5,1x 3,9x2.5 inchesWeight: 490 grs. -- 1 pound',
