      "sku": "FOCAL-SHAPE-50",
      "description": '\n      <p>The <strong>Focal Shape 50</strong> is the versatile monitoring loudspeaker par excellence. Designed for nearfield listening from 30\u2033 away (80cm), it delivers a remarkably extended low-end frequency response (50 Hz) despite its compact footprint. Thanks to its portless design and extensive acoustic settings, Shape 50 is ideal for control rooms and production studios measuring less than 130 ft\xB2 (12 m\xB2).</p>\n\n      <p>Handcrafted in France, Shape 50 integrates five major acoustic innovations that maximize acoustic transparency, providing a wide and extremely precise stereo image without masking effects in the critical midrange.</p>\n\n      <h3>Flax Sandwich Cone & TMD Surround</h3>\n      <p>The 5-inch woofer utilizes Focal\u2019s patented <strong>Flax sandwich cone</strong>, featuring organic French flax fiber encased between two structural glass-fiber skins. This structure achieves an ideal ratio of low mass, high rigidity, and superior internal damping. Enhanced by a <strong>TMD (Tuned Mass Damper) surround</strong>, it provides an exceptionally linear response between 1 and 2 kHz while slashing harmonic distortion.</p>\n\n      <h3>"M"-Shaped Inverted Dome Tweeter</h3>\n      <p>Focal\u2019s 1-inch aluminium-magnesium inverted dome tweeter features a proprietary <strong>\u201CM\u201D profile</strong> and a Poron\xAE suspension. This architecture yields remarkably low directivity, allowing engineers greater freedom of movement across the console without losing high-frequency detail, extending smoothly up to 35 kHz.</p>\n\n      <h3>Dual Side-Firing Passive Radiators (Portless Enclosure)</h3>\n      <p>Engineered without conventional bass-reflex ports, Shape 50 incorporates <strong>dual 5-inch side-firing passive radiators</strong>. This allows the monitor to be placed directly adjacent to studio walls or corners without the acoustic turbulence, port compression, or low-end boominess typical of ported monitors.</p>\n\n      <h3>Neutral Inductance Circuit (N.I.C.) & Class-AB Amplification</h3>\n      <p>Focal\u2019s proprietary <strong>N.I.C. technology</strong> utilizes an optimized Faraday ring to stabilize the magnetic field regardless of driver excursion, current, or signal frequency. Driven by discrete Class-AB bi-amplification (60W woofer + 25W tweeter \u2014 85W total RMS), the monitor delivers effortless dynamic headroom and pristine transient response.</p>\n\n      <h3>Key Technical Specifications:</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>Frequency Response (\xB13 dB):</strong> 50 Hz \u2013 35 kHz</li>\n        <li><strong>Maximum SPL:</strong> 106 dB SPL (peak @ 1 m)</li>\n        <li><strong>Woofer Amplifier:</strong> 60 W Class-AB RMS</li>\n        <li><strong>Tweeter Amplifier:</strong> 25 W Class-AB RMS (85 W Total RMS)</li>\n        <li><strong>Inputs:</strong> Balanced XLR (10 k\u03A9), Unbalanced RCA (10 k\u03A9 with sensitivity compensation)</li>\n        <li><strong>Acoustic EQ Settings:</strong> High-pass filter (Full / 45 / 60 / 90 Hz), Bass shelving (0\u2013250 Hz, \xB16 dB), Midrange EQ (160 Hz, Q=1, \xB13 dB), Treble shelving (4.5\u201335 kHz, \xB13 dB)</li>\n        <li><strong>Cabinet:</strong> 15 mm MDF, genuine walnut veneer, black painted finish</li>\n        <li><strong>Mounting:</strong> Underside M6 inserts for K&M\xAE table/mic stands; Rear M6 inserts for wall/ceiling brackets</li>\n        <li><strong>Dimensions (H x W x D):</strong> 312 x 191 x 242 mm (12.3 x 7.5 x 9.5")</li>\n        <li><strong>Weight:</strong> 6.5 kg (14.3 lbs)</li>\n      </ul>\n    ',
