      "description": 'Take full control of your tone with the JOYO K8 Multi-Effects Processor. With 160+ amp and effect models, a 5\u201D touchscreen, and studio-grade connectivity, the K8 is your all-in-one rig for live shows, studio recording, and silent practice. Perfect for guitarists who demand performance, versatility, and power \u2014 now available in India\nCountry of Origin: China\nKey Features\n\u2705 160+ Amp & Effect Models: Includes distortions, modulations, delays, reverbs, and more\n\u2705 11 Simultaneous Effect Modules: Create layered, powerful chains with drag-and-drop simplicity\n\u2705 400 Preset Slots: Save and switch instantly during live shows\n\u2705 5" Touchscreen: Multi-touch interface for intuitive effect management\n\u2705 8 Customizable Footswitches: Control FX, tuner, looper, mute, and preset groups\n\u2705 Seamless Transitions: Spillover mode ensures smooth delay/reverb carryovers\n\u2705 USB-C Audio Interface: Record to DAWs or stream with ultra-low latency\n\u2705 Built-in Looper: 60-second loop time, plus 90 drum patterns for practice\n\u2705 Tour-Ready Build: Rugged aluminum body made for gigs, rehearsals, and travel\nTechnical Specifications\nEffects Module Slots: 11\nEffects Types: 163\nPreset Storage: 400 tones\nIR Format: WAV (44.1kHz / 24-bit)\nIR Sample Size: 1024\nInput: 1/4" Mono, 1M\u03A9\nOutput: 2 x 1/4" Mono, 600\u03A9\nPhones: 1/4" Stereo, 10\u03A9\nSend/Return: 2 x Mono (Send: 600\u03A9, Return: 1M\u03A9)\nAUX IN: 1/8" Stereo, 47k\u03A9\nEXP2: 1/4" TRS, 10k\u03A9\nXLR OUT: 2 Balanced, 600\u03A9\nMIDI: 2 x 5-pin female connectors\nUSB: Type-C (OTG + USB Audio)\nAudio Quality: A/D: 32-bit 105dB, D/A: 32-bit 108dB\nPower: DC 9V 1A (center negative)\nDimensions: 380 \xD7 207 \xD7 65 mm\nWeight: 3kg\nPackage Contents\nJOYO K8 Multi-Effects Processor\nPower Adapter & Cable\nUSB Cable\nUser Manual',
