      "sku": "AK-JOYO-R-30-TIDAL-WAVE-BASS-PREAMP-PEDAL-MUGZ03PP",
      "description": `The JOYO Tidal Wave is for bassists who want a shaped, cabinet-emulated tone without hauling an amp to every gig. With Blend, Presence, and Drive controls plus a sweepable 3-band EQ, it's a strong fit for gigging bassists who need a reliable direct tone at front-of-house, session and home players who want a studio-ready DI straight into an interface, and anyone chasing that driven, present '90s bass sound across Pop, Funk, or Metal.
Vivid Cabinet Simulation
Blend mixes your clean dry signal with a cabinet-emulated tone, while Level, Presence, and Drive shape the character and intensity of that emulated sound. The result is a live-show feel that goes well beyond a simple tone knob.

JOYO Tidal Wave full panel with Level, Blend, Presence, Drive knobs
2
EQ That Sweeps to Your Instrument
Treble, Middle, and Bass controls offer deep tone coloration, and two shift switches move the center frequencies to match your bass and your mix \u2014 Middle between 500Hz and 1kHz, Bass between 40Hz and 80Hz.

JOYO Tidal Wave full pedal panel
3
Fits Different Music Genres
JOYO built Tidal Wave to be equally at home across Pop, Funk, and Metal \u2014 from clean, present low end to a driven, aggressive growl, all from one box on your board.

JOYO Tidal Wave labeled top panel controls
Procraft Insight
Start with Blend around the middle to hear both your dry tone and the cab emulation together, then push Drive and Presence to taste \u2014 that's the quickest way to find the iconic '90s growl this pedal is built around.

THE BRAND
JOYO Technology
JOYO Technology is a professional company specializing in R&D, manufacturing, and marketing of digital products for music education and performance \u2014 spanning amplifiers, effects pedals, power supplies, audio interfaces, tuners, and more. JOYO holds its own core acoustic technology and has applied for multiple utility patents, with products trusted by musicians and manufacturers worldwide.

R Series
30+ single-block pedals engineered for focused, no-compromise tones
Studio-Ready
Balanced DI outputs built for direct stage and studio use
Global Reach
Trusted by players and partner manufacturers worldwide
Engineered With Purpose
Chassis
Built to Hold Seven Controls
At 130 \xD7 110 \xD7 50 mm and 442 g, Tidal Wave is sized to comfortably house 7 controls, 2 shift switches, and 3 output options without feeling cramped.

Noise Control
Ground-Lift Switch
In certain setups, ground loops cause hum from signal interference. The Ground-Lift switch cuts that noise efficiently without needing an external DI box.

Power
DC 9V, Center-Minus
Runs on a standard DC 9V center-negative supply drawing under 100mA \u2014 an easy fit on any multi-pedal power supply.

Status LED
Three LED Modes
Sync ties both side LEDs to the footswitch. Always keeps the side LEDs lit as ambient lighting regardless of footswitch state. Off disables the side LEDs entirely \u2014 the top LED still follows the footswitch in every mode.

Specifications
Effect Type	Bass Preamp / DI
Controls	Level, Blend, Presence, Drive, Treble, Middle, Bass
EQ Shift Switches	Middle: 500Hz/1kHz, Bass: 40Hz/80Hz
Footswitches	1
Input Jack	6.35mm (1/4")
Output Jack	6.35mm (1/4")
DI Output	Balanced XLR, with Ground-Lift and Pad (signal attenuation) switches
Headphone Output	Yes
Input Impedance	1M\u03A9
Output Impedance	1K\u03A9
Working Current	<100mA
Working Voltage	DC 9V (center minus)
LED Mode	Sync, Always, Off
Dimensions	130 \xD7 110 \xD7 50 mm
Weight	442 g
Three Ways Out
Output 01
1/4" Output
Standard instrument-level output to run straight into your amp, exactly like any other pedal on your board.

Output 02
Balanced XLR DI
Send a balanced, noise-resistant signal straight to a mixer or interface \u2014 with Ground-Lift and Pad switches on hand for problem stages and hot signals.

03
Headphone Output
Practice or dial in tones silently, without needing an amp or interface in the room.

Procraft Insight
Most preamp pedals give you one way to get sound out. Tidal Wave gives you three \u2014 amp, front-of-house, and headphones \u2014 from the same box, at the same time.`,
