      "sku": "AK-NORD-ELECTRO-7-HP-73-KEY-STAGE-PIANO-MUG8KYVK",
      "description": "Nord\u2019s Electro 7 73 HP is a durable and polished stage keyboard with a hammer-action keybed that provides a wide range of sound possibilities to improve your keyboard performance on stage or in the studio. The Electro 7 builds on Nord\u2019s tradition of innovation and excellence in stage keyboard design, offering a professional piano-style feel and a wide range of sounds.\n\n\n\nThe Electro 7 73 HP, with its distinct organ, piano, and synth sections, is the centerpiece of a wide universe of keyboard sounds, offering an outstanding selection of premium keyboard sounds with high-quality control to support your creative vision. The new architecture and control panel make it simple to browse and alter sounds, and the huge color display allows for easy visualization of settings even in low-light stage circumstances.\n\n\n\nWith a wide timbral range suitable for both blues bars and church stages, the organ section provides a full palette of professional sounds to perform with, including B3 and B3 Bass, Vox, Farfisa, Soft B3, and Pipe Organ models from Nord Organ 3. Use the LED drawbar controls to shape your sound, and turn on the rotary speaker effect with three mic location settings for luscious and realistic Leslie tones. The piano portion lets you tickle the ivories like never before, and it is compatible with the Nord Piano Library, offering endless timbral choices. Shape your piano sound with the integrated dynamic compression, unison, and timbre settings to create your own unique sound.\n\n\n\nAdd intriguing synth tones to any performance with the Electro 7\u2019s enhanced synth section, which includes samples, analog waveforms, and FM synthesis algorithms for a diverse spectrum of sounds to shape and explore. Adjustable vibrato and voicing choices provide timbral diversity to your patches, while the resonant low-pass filter shapes warm sounds. Compatible with the Nord Sample Library, the synth section allows you to go beyond standard instrumental tones, allowing for both innovative sound design and nostalgic synth tones. Layer your sounds to create unique combinations of traditional and modern tones, or use them in split compositions for the ideal performance setup.\n\n\n\nThe enlarged Effects area of the Electro 7 allows you to create beautiful studio magic by offering individual effects per layer. Add from a broad selection of unique and classic effects to extend and shape each layer of your sounds, giving you a wealth of creative alternatives and studio-quality sounds to experiment with. The intricate design and high-quality craftsmanship, like with all Nord keyboards, provide a road-ready instrument without sacrificing expressive potential.\n\n\n\nThe sumptuous Kawai Triple Sensor Hammer Action 73-key keybed delivers a true piano feel in a gig-ready, compact package, while the freely assignable expression pedal inputs allow you to creatively manipulate practically any sound or effect parameter. If you\u2019re looking for a hammer-action instrument that will give you complete creative control over any keyboard workflow, the Nord Electro 73 HP is a high-quality option that will inspire you for years to come.\n\n\n\nPowerful features provide the tools you need.\n\nNord packed the Electro 7 with loads of features to make gigging and recording easier than ever. A new huge color display allows you to quickly examine your settings, effects, and more. You may also create splits and layers that mix the organ, piano, and sampling portions. The new Synth section has more settings for sample playback, analog and FM synthesis, mono and legato modes, glide and unison, a filter with resonance and FM partials, an ADR envelope for amp and filter, and synth vibrato.\n\n\n\nThe piano section now includes dynamic compression and unison settings. The Effects section has also been enhanced with controls for Ring Modulator, Rate/Amount, and Vibe, as well as a Compressor that can be selected globally or per section, a global Reverb with layer Send, and new amps, including the stunning Suitcase and Brit versions.\n\n\n\nNord Electro 7 HP Features:\n\n Advanced stage piano featuring popular Nord Piano, organ, and synth sounds.\n Features 61 or 73 semi-weighted waterfall keys or 73-key hammer action.\n The organ part is based on the Nord Organ 3 with improved transistor organ models.\n New rotary speaker with adjustable mic placements and slow/fast/stop settings.\n Drawbar Live mode with settings for upper and lower manual.\n LED-enabled physical drawbars\n Improved piano part with dynamic compression and unison.\n The new synth section includes sample playback, analog and FM synthesis, mono/legato mode, glide and unison, filter with resonance and FM partials, ADR envelope for amp and filter, and synth vibrato.\n Improved Effects section with Rate and Amount, Ring Modulator, and Vibe settings.\n New amp models: Suitcase and Brit.\n Select a compressor by section or globally.\n Global reverb with per-layer send.\n Improved program section with new color display, Live Mode, and push encoder for easy program selection.\n Sleek, lightweight, and roadworthy chassis.\n Handcrafted in Sweden.",
