      "description": "The acclaimed Nord Organ is back - reborn and reimagined as the all-new Nord Organ 3. The latest generation of Nord's Organ series featuring massive improvements to sound, design and performance. With a greatly enhanced organ engine, added modulation effects and a new exceptional-sounding rotary speaker emulation, the Nord Organ 3 offers an unsurpassed level of detail and realism.\n\n\n\nNew panel design with OLED display\nTriple sensor keybeds\nLED indicators for preset drawbar settings\nAux output with routing options for Bass/Pedal drawbars and more\nPer program Transpose function\n11-pin Leslie connector\nHigh level output\nEnhanced B3 organ model\nNew and improved Chorus/Vibrato\nImproved Farfisa and Vox organ models\nBrand new Rotary Speaker emulation\nMultiple options for microphone placement\n3 Drive Type options\nNew British amp and speaker emulation\nAdditional settings for Rotary Speaker\nTwo distinct Pipe Organ emulations\nNew Synth Bass options based on classic pedal synthesizers\nBrand new Spring reverb\nExpanded Reverb section with Pre-Rotary option\nDelay with new Analog mode and Feedback filters\nNew Modulation effects including Phaser, Tremolo, Ring Mod, Flanger and Chorus.\nEqualizer with sweepable middle band\n\n\nImproved Organ Models\n\nThe Nord Organ 3 features a refined B3 emulation capturing every nuance of the legendary organ sound. The vastly improved Vox and Farfisa organ models capture the characteristics of the original tone generators and filters with great precision, including the complex interaction between combined registers.\n\n\n\nEnhanced Vibrato and Chorus Scanner\n\nReworked from the ground up the new vibrato and chorus scanner captures the unique character of the classic designs.\n\n\n\nNew Rotary Speaker emulation\n\nWith a brand new approach to recreating not only the classic rotary sound, but also the characteristics of both the amp and speakers, the Nord Organ 3 features an exceptional Rotary Speaker emulation with multiple microphone perspectives.\n\n\n\nExpanded Effects\n\nThe Reverb section features 6 different types including a brand new Spring Reverb as well as Booth, Room, Stage, Hall and Cathedral options. The new Pre-Rotary feature allows the reverb to be placed before the Rotary Speaker. The upgraded Effects section also includes a Delay with new Analog mode and feedback filters for a wider range of sonic options.",
