      "description": "Description\n\nStereo amp and cab emulation pedal with nine famous mic/speaker pairs, end-to-end amp voicing modifications, live and preset modes, and customization with the UAFX mobile app.\n\n \n\nProduct Description\n\nGet the mythical tones that enchanted legends. \n\n \n\nThe Enigmatic \u201882 Overdrive Special Amp lets you experience the heavenly tube amp sound that captivated legends like John Mayer, Stevie Ray Vaughan, Robben Ford, Larry Carlton, Joe Bonamassa, and Carlos Santana.*\n\n\n\nPerfectly capturing not one, but numerous custom Overdrive Special amps spanning 30 years \u2014 with their fabled touch-sensitivity, colorful preamp choices, tone stack mods, plus carefully curated mic and speaker cabinets \u2014 Enigmatic '82 is like having a handmade amp, built just for you.\n\n\n\n*Use of artist names does not constitute official endorsement of UAFX Enigmatic \u201882 Overdrive Special Amp.\n\n\n\nGet Your Hands on Three Decades of Super-Rare ODS Tone\n\nUniversal Audio wore out the rolodex to get exclusive access to numerous original Overdrive Special amps, spanning three essential eras of these mythical tone monsters. From the 1970\u2019s Santa Cruz models that brought the ODS into the light, to later LA iterations in the \u201880s and \u201890s used on countless legendary sessions, Enigmatic \u201882 puts the sound of these fabled amps under your fingertips. \n\n\n\nBuild Your Own Boutique Amp in Custom Mode\n\nLooking for that rare tone that\u2019s entirely your own? Flip Enigmatic \u201882 into Custom mode and go under the hood to design your own unique ODS voice in the UAFX mobile app. Mix and match different amp modifications, from the FET preamp and HRM overdrive voicings, right down to the late \u201980s Skyliner tone stack option, output tube bias and power supply stiffness, and more.\n\n\n\nPlay Essential Rock & Jazz Modes \n\nA hallmark of the original amps, Enigmatic '82's Jazz and Rock modes let you enjoy shimmery cloud-like cleans to creamy overdrive that blooms with dynamics. Whether you favor intricate chord work or expressive lead playing, you\u2019ll instantly find the classic ODS sound that responds to every nuance of your touch and preserves note clarity when overdriven. \n\n\n\nExplore a Million Dollar Amp & Cabinet Collection\n\nEnigmatic '82 offers three handpicked mic and speaker combinations, along with six bonus cabs, immaculately captured with UA\u2019s exclusive Dynamic Speaker Modeling. \n\n\n\nThree Stock Cabinets\n\n1x12 Black GB25\n2x12 Boutique D65\n2x12 Brute\n\n\nSix Bonus Cabinets**\n\n4x12 UK V30\n2x12 JBF120\n1x12 Black EV12\n4x12 Stripped GB \n1x12 JBG125\n2x12 D-EV12\n\n\n**Available with the UAFX mobile app.\n\n\n\nTake Control with the UAFX Mobile App\n\nWith the UAFX mobile app giving you deep customization of all Enigmatic '82\u2019s essential controls, you can tailor everything from preamp settings and output tube bias, to live/preset modes, and more. Plus, explore artist presets crafted by the world's top guitarists and Overdrive Special aficionados. \n\n\n\nKey Features\n\nGet the fabled Overdrive Special amp tones made famous by John Mayer, SRV, Robben Ford, Joe Bonamassa, and Santana*\nPowerful UAFX dual-engine delivers the most authentic emulation of three decades of the original handmade amps ever placed in a stompbox\n\n\nDial in Jazz and Rock modes to experience cloud-like cleans and creamy overdrive that blooms in your hands, or create your own tailored Custom ODS voicing\nSelect between nine classic mic/speaker pairs; plus '70s Santa Cruz, late \u201880s Skyliner, and \u201890s Hot Rubber Monkey preamp mods for the ultimate tone quest\nExperience UA\u2019s groundbreaking Dynamic Speaker Modeling from the award-winning OX Amp Top Box\nCustomize the entire amp, from preamp to output tube bias, plus explore artist presets and more with the UAFX mobile app\nSpecifications\n\nPower requirements: Isolated 9VDC, center-negative, 400 mA minimum (sold separately)\n\nInputs: 2 x \xBC\u201D TS (right input for stereo connections and 4-cable mode)",
